xnu 0471: premap the config, dbi, elbi and iatu windows too

Measured 2026-11-26: with 0470 the premap completes and the link comes up
(`pcie0 link up gen=2 width=1`), then the worker stops before `qca6490 id`.
Premap covered the BAR and the four AHB pages only; `wifi_config_identity()`
still maps the config aperture itself and `wifi_link()` maps DBI, ELBI and
iATU from the worker, so the worker still calls `ml_io_map()`.

All seven windows are taken by `mondrian_wifi_premap()` on the boot thread, and
the log prints the four new virtual addresses next to the BAR one.
diff --git a/bsd/dev/mondrian_wifi.c b/bsd/dev/mondrian_wifi.c
